text:
sam: starting a tiny PR to help teams adopt json_schema for structured output. Goals: migration checklist, minimal py/ts snippets, streaming caveat, and fix two broken anchors. PR: https://github.com/redwood-inference/docs/pull/1805
ain: nice. quick ask: include a one-paragraph decision heuristic on when to require schemas vs allow free-form parsing
jorge: also call out SDK key casing up front (python: structured_output, js/ts: structuredOutput) — we still see mixed examples in the wild
sam: noted. adding a short migration checklist and a small fallback pattern (retry once then fallback to text parser). draft snippets below for quick review:
```python
# python snippet: function/tool call with JSON Schema and simple fallback
from redwood import RedwoodClient
c = RedwoodClient()
r = c.call_tool(
    name="price_check",
    input={"items": [{"sku":"x1","qty":2}]},
    structured_output={
        "type": "json_schema",
        "schema": {"type":"object","properties":{"total":{"type":"number"}},"required":["total"]}
    }
)
if getattr(r, 'errors', None):
    # retry once then fallback
    r = c.call_tool(..., retry=True)
    if getattr(r, 'errors', None):
        fallback = text_parser(r.raw_text)
```
```js
// js snippet: camelCase style
import { RedClient } from '@redwood/inference';
const client = new RedClient();
const res = await client.callTool({
  name: 'price_check',
  input: { items: [{ sku: 'x1', qty: 2 }] },
  structuredOutput: { type: 'json_schema', schema: { type: 'object', properties: { total: { type: 'number' } }, required: ['total'] } }
});
if (res.errors && res.errors.length) {
  // retry then fallback
}
```
ain: add a one-liner about streaming: when streaming=true you can get partial JSON; recommend `stream=false` or `buffer_full_response=True` for strict validation. link runtime issue: https://github.com/redwood-inference/runtime/issues/432
jorge: please replace two old anchors in landing: `/docs/tooling/call` -> `/docs/tool-calling/` and `/docs/structured-output/#jsonschema` -> `/docs/structured-output/#json-schema` so old bookmarks stop 404ing
sam: will add changelog blurb and note about backporting to stable branch for pinned customers. tagging @support on the PR for visibility
